WEBVTT

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:11.220
今天不要上班，咪养你。
No work today. I'll take care of you.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.480
啊对，今天休假。我忘关闹钟啦。
Oh, right. It's my day off. I forgot the alarm.

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:25.240
你：乖宝过来，先给我亲一口
You: Come here, baby, give me a kiss first.

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:30.220
好吧，只亲一下。咪很忙的。
Okay. Just one. Mii is busy.

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:34.550
好了。现在咪要工作了。先摆拖鞋。
Done. Now Mii works. Slippers first.

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:42.800
你：伸手摸摸咪的头
You: Reach out and pat Mi's head

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:46.490
咪在工作。只摸一小下。
Mii is working. Only a little.

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:52.140
这只要朝这里。咪本来就知道。
This one faces here. Mii knew.

00:00:57.860 --> 00:01:00.360
你：咪真棒，我穿上啦，抱你去厨房好不好
You: Great job, Mi! I've put it on. Shall I carry you to the kitchen?

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:05.130
咪：咪早就知道。你可以抱我。就一下。
Mii knew. You can carry me. A little.

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:09.460
咪：早餐。咪有个计划。
Breakfast. Mii has a plan.

00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:17.920
你：让咪自己打开果酱
You: Let Mi open the jam by itself

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:20.020
咪，我来。你看着。
Mii can do it. Watch.

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:25.240
咪试了下果酱。用爪试的。
Mii tested the jam. With a paw.

00:01:25.640 --> 00:01:31.260
不是故意的。
Not on purpose.

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:35.480
你：你怎么又偷吃果酱，爪子给我舔干净看看
You: Why are you sneaking jam again? Let me see your paws, lick them clean

00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:37.920
咪：咪没有吃。咪是检查。
Mii did not eat it. Mii checked it.

00:01:41.480 --> 00:01:46.470
咪：干净了。咪去买新的果酱。
Clean now. Mii will buy more jam.

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:53.040
你：你一个人去买吗？你怎么买呀，我要看
You: You're going to buy it alone? How will you buy it? I want to watch

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:57.180
咪：咪一个人去。小事。
Mii goes alone. Easy.

00:01:59.040 --> 00:02:00.960
咪：你乖乖休息。咪很快回来。
You rest. Mii will be back soon.

00:02:01.360 --> 00:02:04.310
咪：太高了。咪早就计划好了。
Too high. Mii planned this.

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:10.600
你：喊咪用头顶罐子
You: Call Mi to push the jar with its head

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:13.140
咪：好。先用头。咪早就计划好了。
Okay. Head first. Mii planned this.

00:02:16.600 --> 00:02:21.470
咪：拿到了。差点掉。其实没有。
Got it. Almost fell. Not really.

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:28.160
你：你怎么付钱呀？我要看你结账
You: How will you pay? I want to watch you check out

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:29.690
付钱？简单。咪带了硬币。
Pay? Easy. Mii has coins.

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:40.090
数了两遍。一个都不少。
Counted twice. Not one short.

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:45.720
你：咪好棒，快回家，我要吃你做的饭
You: Good job, Mi! Hurry home, I want to eat the food you make

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:51.590
咪好棒，咪早就知道。
Mii did good. Mii knew.

00:02:51.990 --> 00:02:53.190
酱粘住了。它好像特别舍不得这个锅。
The sauce stuck. It loves this pot.

00:02:53.590 --> 00:02:55.750
第二回合。这次咪听话。
Round two. Mii listens this time.

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:03.280
你：摸摸咪，鼓励它重来
You: Pat Mi and encourage it to try again

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:05.820
咪：咪没难过。咪在想办法。
Mii was not sad. Mii was thinking.

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:12.620
咪：小小一口。咪吹了两遍。
Tiny bite. Mii blew on it twice.

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:16.640
咪：味道如何？
How is it?

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:20.840
你：好吃好吃，还想吃，再喂我一口
You: Yummy, so yummy, I want more. Feed me another bite

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:23.930
还要吗？咪还有。
More? Mii has more.

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:32.940
咪不累。咪只是在休息。只闭眼睛。
Not tired. Mii is resting. Eyes only.

00:03:33.340 --> 00:03:35.550
接下来去沙发？就歇一小会儿。
Sofa next? Just a short rest.

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:38.400
你：抱咪去沙发躺下
You: Carry Mi to the sofa and lie down

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:40.140
抱咪。只是因为你坚持。
Carry Mii. Only because you insist.

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:49.940
闭着眼。没睡。在休息。
Eyes closed. Not sleeping. Resting.

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:54.040
就看一个。你看，小短腿！
Just one video. Look, tiny legs!
